a> data management system.<\/p>","enlarge_text":false}}},"block_order":["heading_CKQ6Gh","text_Bx8Gi8"],"settings":{"video_external":"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=PD3bGVQT_BY","video_description":"","poster_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/The_Andatech_Prodigy_3_in_action.jpg","video_size":"sm","video_autoplay":false,"text_align":"text-center","color_scheme":"default"}},"product_features_rTcRi8":{"type":"product-features","blocks":{"feature_6nhhMY":{"type":"feature","settings":{"heading":"Built in wide angle lens camera","text":"<p>5-megapixel wide angle lens camera for holistic proof of testing.<\/p>","content_align":"text-start","hotspot_x":38,"hotspot_y":15}},"feature_tWBhUa":{"type":"feature","settings":{"heading":"Specific and passive testing modes","text":"<p>Use a mouthpiece for specific testing with BAC results accurate to 3 decimal places.<\/p><p>Use a sampling cup for a quick pass\/fail<\/p>","content_align":"text-start","hotspot_x":66,"hotspot_y":14}},"feature_Atydza":{"type":"feature","settings":{"heading":"Extra large built-in memory","text":"<p>Store up to 100,000 test results with user  information, including if the subject refused to take a test.<\/p>","content_align":"text-start","hotspot_x":70,"hotspot_y":60}},"feature_XX4fGT":{"type":"feature","settings":{"heading":"Hassle-free data management","text":"<p>Each test result and photo is sent directly to <a href=\"https:\/\/andatech.com.au\/pages\/andalink\" target=\"_blank\">Andalink<\/a>, our secure online data management system. No cables or software downloads needed.<\/p>","content_align":"text-start","hotspot_x":43,"hotspot_y":63}}},"block_order":["feature_6nhhMY","feature_tWBhUa","feature_Atydza","feature_XX4fGT"],"settings":{"product":"andatech-prodigy-3-breathalyser","show_content":true,"layout":"text_first","text_align":"text-center","mob_center_text":false,"heading_size":"h3","enlarge_text":false,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Andatech_Prodigy_3_Lite_breathalyser_features.webp","ti